solution.p:
We need to keep our focus on M and take algebra steps that bring us closer to isolating M\text{.}
\begin{aligned}
{xM+G} \amp= {b}\\
{xM+G-G} \amp= {b-G}\\
{xM} \amp= {b-G}\\
{M} \amp= {\frac{b-G}{x}}
\end{aligned}

